### List all leave requests
GET http://localhost:5050/api/leave-requests
Accept: application/json

###

### Filter by status
GET http://localhost:5050/api/leave-requests?status=Pending&page=1&pageSize=5
Accept: application/json

###

### Filter by employee
GET http://localhost:5050/api/leave-requests?employeeId=3
Accept: application/json

###

### Get single leave request
GET http://localhost:5050/api/leave-requests/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a leave request
POST http://localhost:5050/api/leave-requests
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employeeId": 5,
  "startDate": "2025-05-12",
  "endDate": "2025-05-16",
  "type": "Vacation"
}

###

### Approve a request
PUT http://localhost:5050/api/leave-requests/5/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Approved",
  "reviewerNote": "Approved — coverage arranged."
}

###

### Reject a request
PUT http://localhost:5050/api/leave-requests/6/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Rejected",
  "reviewerNote": "Clashes with quarterly close."
}

###

### Delete a pending request
DELETE http://localhost:5050/api/leave-requests/9

###

### List employees (proxies dummyjson.com)
GET http://localhost:5050/api/employees
Accept: application/json

###

### Search employees
GET http://localhost:5050/api/employees?search=Emily
Accept: application/json

###

### Get single employee
GET http://localhost:5050/api/employees/3
Accept: application/json
